# Wrist webcam of this setup (cam-4c, see docs/teleop_guide.md): Logitech C270 (046d:0825).
# USB autosuspend off. With the default (power/control auto: suspended 2 s after it is closed) every open
# woke it with "uvcvideo ... reset_resume error -5" and a USB reset in the kernel log; it came back each
# time, but a failed reset would stop the recording start. Matched on the USB device itself (ATTR).
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="046d", ATTR{idProduct}=="0825", ATTR{power/control}="on"
